## 2. Data Dictionary

### Users

| Column | Type | Constraint | Description |
|---|---|---|---|
| user_id | INT | PK, AUTO_INCREMENT | Unique identifier for a user |
| full_name | VARCHAR(100) | NOT NULL | Name as it appears in the SMS body |
| phone_number | VARCHAR(20) | | Phone number, often partially masked |
| momo_code | VARCHAR(20) | | Merchant/till code, merchant users only |
| user_type | ENUM | NOT NULL, DEFAULT 'customer' | customer / merchant / agent / system |

### Transaction_Categories

| Column | Type | Constraint | Description |
|---|---|---|---|
| category_id | INT | PK, AUTO_INCREMENT | Unique identifier for a category |
| category_name | VARCHAR(50) | NOT NULL, UNIQUE | e.g. Incoming Money, Payment |
| description | VARCHAR(255) | | Short explanation of the category |

### Transactions

| Column | Type | Constraint | Description |
|---|---|---|---|
| transaction_id | INT | PK, AUTO_INCREMENT | Unique identifier for a transaction |
| category_id | INT | FK → Transaction_Categories, NOT NULL | Transaction type |
| financial_transaction_id | VARCHAR(30) | UNIQUE | MTN-issued Financial Transaction Id |
| external_transaction_id | VARCHAR(30) | | External TxId, when present |
| amount | DECIMAL(12,2) | NOT NULL, CHECK > 0 | Transaction amount |
| fee | DECIMAL(10,2) | NOT NULL, DEFAULT 0, CHECK >= 0 | Fee charged |
| balance_after | DECIMAL(12,2) | | Account balance after the transaction |
| currency | CHAR(3) | NOT NULL, DEFAULT 'RWF' | Currency code |
| transaction_datetime | DATETIME | NOT NULL | Parsed from the SMS body |
| sms_date_received | DATETIME | | When the SMS was received on-device |
| status | ENUM | NOT NULL, DEFAULT 'completed' | completed / failed / pending |
| raw_body | TEXT | | Original SMS text, retained for audit |

### Transaction_Participants

| Column | Type | Constraint | Description |
|---|---|---|---|
| participant_id | INT | PK, AUTO_INCREMENT | Unique identifier for the link |
| transaction_id | INT | FK → Transactions, NOT NULL | The transaction |
| user_id | INT | FK → Users, NOT NULL | The participating user |
| role | ENUM | NOT NULL | sender / receiver |

### System_Logs

| Column | Type | Constraint | Description |
|---|---|---|---|
| log_id | INT | PK, AUTO_INCREMENT | Unique identifier for a log entry |
| transaction_id | INT | FK → Transactions, nullable | Null when SMS never became a transaction |
| raw_sms_id | VARCHAR(50) | | Reference to the source SMS |
| log_level | ENUM | NOT NULL, DEFAULT 'info' | info / warning / error |
| message | VARCHAR(255) | NOT NULL | Human-readable log message |
| created_at | DATETIME | NOT NULL, DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP | When the entry was written |

